--- !u!114 &225565825
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 225565823}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "1. DESKTOP CONTROLS:\n  - WASD : Walk in any direction (chalne ke liye)\n 
    - Left Shift (Hold) : Sprint / Fast run (tez bhaagne ke liye)\n  - Mouse : Look
    around smoothly | Click anywhere on screen to lock cursor\n  - [E] Key : Pick
    up Fire Extinguisher / Open Doors / Rescue Civilians / Refill\n  - Left Mouse
    Button (Hold) : Spray Extinguisher (Aag bujhane ke liye)\n  - [G] or [Q] : Drop
    held extinguisher | [Esc] : Pause game\n\n2. OBJECTIVES (AAPKA MISSION):\n  -
    Mission 1 (Fire Control): Enter the building -> Pick up red extinguisher -> Put
    out lobby fire -> Go forward.\n  - Mission 2 (Human Rescue): Find 2 trapped civilians
    (Alex in Office A, Maya in Office B) -> Press E to rescue them.\n  - Mission
    3 (Final Escape): Run through smoke corridor -> Watch Oxygen level -> Reach green
    Emergency Exit!\n\n3. SURVIVAL RULES:\n  - Stay away from high flames to prevent
    Health damage.\n  - Inside smoke, Oxygen drops rapidly! Step into fresh air or
    complete rescue quickly."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
